      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1831cd9374b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in the UK remains one of the most rewarding choices for Nepali students seeking world-class education and global career opportunities. But with the UK tightening visa rules for the 2025–26 academic cycle, you must be fully prepared — both academically and financially — to avoid delays or rejections."
        }
